## Third-party media attribution

The exercise images and animation GIFs bundled with (or downloaded by) this
application are the property of **Gym Visual** (https://gymvisual.com/) and are
distributed under permission for non-commercial use at 180×180 resolution with
attribution, as sourced from the
[exercises-dataset](https://github.com/hasaneyldrm/exercises-dataset) project.

Each exercise record carries its attribution notice, displayed in the
application whenever a user views an exercise guide. If you redistribute
BichoFit, keep this attribution intact.
